    "repeated": [
      {
        "text": "你的日主为己，四柱为辛未、丙申、己未、戊辰；本节的命理机制从日主、月令与命盘结构出发。",
        "count": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "支持与承载条件会改变同一结构的实际表现，因此需要同时保留资源、支持、恢复与制衡条件。",
        "count": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "没有足够资料支持的个人经历、关系事实或现实结论仍然保持开放，不在本报告中作推断。",
        "count": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "这份解读只围绕你的命盘展开，实际处境与个人选择仍需分别核对。",
        "count": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "your day master is 己, with four pillars 辛未, 丙申, 己未, 戊辰; the mechanism considered here begins with the day master, month branch and the structure of your chart.",
        "count": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "support and carrying conditions can change how the same structure is expressed, so resources, support, recovery and counterweights must remain part of the reading.",
        "count": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "personal experiences, relationship facts and real-life conclusions that lack sufficient information remain open and are not inferred in this report.",
        "count": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "this reading concerns your own chart; your lived circumstances and personal choices still need to be considered individually.",
        "count": 9
      }
    ]
